<title>ITALY: MOTOR RACING-PRACTICE TIMES FOR SAN MARINO GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-PRACTICE TIMES FOR SAN MARINO GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>IMOLA, Italy 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after</p>
<p>Friday's practice session for Sunday's San Marino Grand Prix</p>
<p>motor race:</p>
<p>1. Eddie Irvine (Britain) Ferrari one minute and 25.981</p>
<p>seconds (average speed 2.417 kph)</p>
<p>2. Michael Schumacher (Germany) Ferrari 1:25.997</p>
<p>3. Gerhard Berger (Austria) Benetton 1:26.259</p>
<p>4. Jean Alesi (France) Benetton 1:26.382</p>
<p>5. Jacques Villeneuve (Canada) Williams 1:26.449</p>
<p>6. David Coulthard (Britain) McLaren 1:26.549</p>
<p>7. Heinz-Harald Frentzen (Germany) Williams 1:26.600</p>
<p>8. Rubens Barrichello (Brazil) Stewart 1:26.679</p>
<p>9. Olivier Panis (France) Prost 1:26.779</p>
<p>10. Nicola Larini (Italy) Sauber 1:26.831</p>
<p>11. Johnny Herbert (Britain) Sauber 1:26.842</p>
<p>12. Mika Hakkinen (Finland) McLaren 1:27.184</p>
</text>
